                        ],
                        "form": "siebziger"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "410092ae-0813-3402-b994-991b7ba4a56d",
                        "entry_id": "13ac2e9a-409b-345d-b086-15ceb8275273",
                        "glosses": [
                            "die Kardinalzahl siebzig betreffend in Bezug auf ein bestimmtes Jahr, einen bestimmten Jahrgang, eine bestimmte Nummer, einen bestimmten Wert, eine bestimmte Zahl oder dergleichen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15fdafa3-250b-401a-ae42-6bd44180fae6",
                                "sense_id": "410092ae-0813-3402-b994-991b7ba4a56d",
                                "text": "„Marie zieht die Plätze auf der hinteren Querbank vor, weil sie die Fenster zur Seite haben, und bis in die siebziger Straßen behält sie den westlichen Bürgersteig des Broadway im Blick, auf der Suche nach Kindern, Passanten, Polizisten, die sie kennt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64d40e5e-bdcd-4e57-b3f1-5474bc5854ea",
                                "sense_id": "410092ae-0813-3402-b994-991b7ba4a56d",
                                "text": "„Am Anfang des deutschen Imperialismus steht die Wagnersche Götterdämmerung, die begeisterte Prophetie des eigenen Untergangs, deren Komposition gleichzeitig mit dem siegreichen siebziger Krieg in Angriff genommen wurde.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e045789-0e79-3786-a9a3-fcf8a2c94fa5",
                        "entry_id": "13ac2e9a-409b-345d-b086-15ceb8275273",
                        "glosses": [
                            "das Jahrzehnt eines bestimmten Jahrhunderts betreffend, das die Jahre 70 bis 79 umfasst"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "nur attributiv, nicht adverbiell"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa66e62c-2598-4997-aa42-01b8dd5767a7",
                                "sense_id": "6e045789-0e79-3786-a9a3-fcf8a2c94fa5",
                                "text": "„Portikus und Balkon bilden das Zentrum in der Vorderfront der zweieinhalbgeschossigen Villa, einer Mischung aus neugotischer und malerischer Architektur aus den siebziger Jahren des vorigen Jahrhunderts.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0fac134-88de-336e-8b15-937fe43d9613",
                        "entry_id": "13ac2e9a-409b-345d-b086-15ceb8275273",
                        "glosses": [
                            "das Lebensjahrzehnt, das zwischen dem siebzigsten und achtzigsten Geburtstag liegt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "nur attributiv, nicht adverbiell"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36086322-5588-48f6-8245-f3be980f90c1",
                                "sense_id": "c0fac134-88de-336e-8b15-937fe43d9613",
                                "text": "„Die Herren nähern sich mit großen Schritten der Mitte ihrer siebziger Jahre.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd7c1a70-8cae-47d1-a6db-16cdd5bccc6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "13ac2e9a-409b-345d-b086-15ceb8275273",
                        "source_sense_id": "6e045789-0e79-3786-a9a3-fcf8a2c94fa5",
                        "source_sense_description": "die Jahre 70–79 eines Jahrzehnts betreffend",
                        "target_lang_word": "seventies",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "seventies",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31f07b1e-f32b-391c-871b-c514373ccf67",
                                        "entry_id": "a0de5341-0b13-303c-8bff-28b1d5338f93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "plural of seventy"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "seventies",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2c391dd-099d-3724-9761-755b22abc57f",
                                        "entry_id": "cc94826e-055a-3e49-97a4-9306e5db545e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The decade of the 1870s, 1970s, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cf3e524-04aa-45af-b5c6-d5e5cf16f82f",
                                                "sense_id": "a2c391dd-099d-3724-9761-755b22abc57f",
                                                "text": "I'm so bored of this decade, the seventies can't come soon enough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "852a245f-27ba-49bc-a1a5-623093a96196",
                                                "sense_id": "a2c391dd-099d-3724-9761-755b22abc57f",
                                                "text": "Our readers — and contributors — are apt to elect a good deal according to years. The seventies and eighties, we may suppose, are concerned for the large educational and cultural interests of their Alma Mater; the nineties are deep in the practical and business activities; the noughties are not naughty, but still young enough to sport a fantastic costume at reunion and let the college wag as it will; the oneties are the really wise as to what the college ought to be, especially on its athletic side, but as contributors modest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da0af5ea-d8ac-4e0c-8989-91b6222b6b6d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2c391dd-099d-3724-9761-755b22abc57f",
                                                "text": "'The Bride' [a snowdrop variety], found in the early Seventies at Foxcote Farm near Cheltenham, was his first discovery. It's a poculiform (cup-shaped) G. elwesii] with six pure white petals of the same length."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fee2b2a2-a485-35eb-83d8-4e0ceb5cb58c",
                                        "entry_id": "cc94826e-055a-3e49-97a4-9306e5db545e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The decade of one's life from age 70 through age 79."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d71e5c8e-f157-4ab7-a581-850f3532e039",
                                                "sense_id": "fee2b2a2-a485-35eb-83d8-4e0ceb5cb58c",
                                                "text": "My grandma met her third wife when they were both in their seventies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ece85cb-f748-3a03-8235-e2884bd941c7",
                                        "entry_id": "cc94826e-055a-3e49-97a4-9306e5db545e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The range between 70 and 79."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dea798f-8667-49c9-9b1a-771e80da7866",
                                                "sense_id": "7ece85cb-f748-3a03-8235-e2884bd941c7",
                                                "text": "You don't need your parka today, it's in the seventies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "seventies",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "daaf63a3-0611-3a27-9f1f-dfb4fddd6476",
                                        "entry_id": "c96b7a03-ec13-3c86-b40e-c5007aaa2940",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From or evoking the 71st through 80th years of a century (chiefly the 1970s)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3edf1729-c0e4-4bb4-bd71-a28e2f9f3af6",
                                                "sense_id": "daaf63a3-0611-3a27-9f1f-dfb4fddd6476",
                                                "text": "I know the theme of the school dance is \"The 1970s\" but is covering the walls, floor, and ceiling with tie-dye too seventies?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "254216a6-6b01-4b08-a9c4-22306689c657",
                                                "sense_id": "daaf63a3-0611-3a27-9f1f-dfb4fddd6476",
                                                "text": "Among rock critics and journalists, there is an overwhelming bias to view the late sixties in a positive light and seventies music as an unfortunate decline into commercialism at the expense of musical authenticity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
